687
00:22:04,404 --> 00:22:05,530
And mistake five.

688
00:22:05,710 --> 00:22:08,132
Going it alone without an accountant and

689
00:22:08,132 --> 00:22:10,493
a lawyer who know small business deals.

690
00:22:10,844 --> 00:22:12,567
Before you can judge a deal,

691
00:22:12,567 --> 00:22:15,212
you need to understand how small businesses

692
00:22:15,212 --> 00:22:16,382
