For very small owner operated businesses,

696
00:22:23,631 --> 00:22:27,405
brokers often use something called seller's discretionary

697
00:22:27,405 --> 00:22:29,921
earnings, which is the profit plus the

698
00:22:29,921 --> 00:22:33,099
