699
00:22:33,099 --> 00:22:34,489
through the business.

700
00:22:34,669 --> 00:22:36,734
It shows how much cash one full

701
00:22:36,734 --> 00:22:38,466
time owner could take out.

702
00:22:38,816 --> 00:22:40,511
Multiples vary widely.

703
00:22:40,691 --> 00:22:43,219
A tiny business that depends entirely on

704
00:22:43,219 --> 00:22:45,179
its owner might sell for one to

705
00:22:45,179 --> 00:22:46,379
