720
00:23:15,865 --> 00:23:17,664
Your accountant should check every one.

721
00:23:18,015 --> 00:23:19,698
And remember the simple test.

722
00:23:19,878 --> 00:23:21,113
After paying the loan,

723
00:23:21,113 --> 00:23:23,191
can the business pay you a reasonable

724
00:23:23,191 --> 00:23:25,044
salary and still leave a cushion?

725
00:23:25,224 --> 00:23:26,946
If the answer is no at the

726
00:23:26,946 --> 00:23:29,329
