00:23:39,421 --> 00:23:40,929
and introduce yourself.

733
00:23:41,109 --> 00:23:44,139
Learn how everything works before changing anything.

734
00:23:44,319 --> 00:23:45,580
Make sure payroll,

735
00:23:45,580 --> 00:23:48,522
suppliers and bills keep running smoothly.

736
00:23:48,702 --> 00:23:50,455
Stability is the goal.

737
00:23:50,806 --> 00:23:52,326
Days thirty to sixty.

738
00:23:52,506 --> 00:23:53,842
Learn the numbers deeply.

739
00:23:54,022 --> 00:23:55,611
Track weekly sales,

740
00:23:55,611 --> 00:23:56,866
costs and cash.

741
00:23:57,046 --> 00:23:58,776
Identify the quick wins,

742
