746
00:24:08,513 --> 00:24:10,335
Days sixty to one hundred.

747
00:24:10,515 --> 00:24:12,733
Start improving, carefully.

748
00:24:12,913 --> 00:24:14,932
Make one or two changes at a

749
00:24:14,932 --> 00:24:17,023
